WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.605
A shower from a rock.

00:02.305 --> 00:07.686
One of the best showers of the year, the Geminids in December, does not come from a comet.

00:08.136 --> 00:14.150
It comes from this asteroid, Phaethon, whose path takes it closer to the Sun than Mercury.

00:14.600 --> 00:20.482
Nobody is sure whether it is a rock that behaves like a comet or a comet that has died.
